    npx:wasCreatedAt <https://nanodash.knowledgepixels.com/>;
    rdfs:label "Project Delphi evidence item";
    skos:changeNote "Migrates the template to Delphi ontology 2.0: every term in the retired probknow namespace (https://w3id.org/probknow/ontology/) is replaced by its https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/ equivalent (EvidenceItem, statisticalTest, pValue, vovkSellkeMaxPRatio, weightOfEvidence), the evidence item IRI is minted under https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/, and the reporting paper is linked with prov:wasDerivedFrom in place of the deprecated derivedFromPaper. Records made in 2.0 terms can now truthfully declare this template in nt:wasCreatedFromTemplate.";
